   "cancelling" claim is real, not a `feb[1:]`-empty vacuity.
   Mutation-tested all 9 named SignedNet/negSumSigned call sites against
   the SHIPPED `cb9_negzero_http_test.go` only (not my own throwaway
   tests):
     - handleKPIDetail expAmt (line 555)        -> killed (detail test)
     - negSumSigned body (line 690)             -> killed (month-detail test)
     - classifiedMonthlyTotals (line 714)       -> killed (export + detail)
     - handleKPIExport expAmt (line 943)        -> killed (export test)
     - chart-walk hcAmt (line 1109)             -> SURVIVES (no test fails)
     - chart-walk livingMonth (line 1119)       -> SURVIVES
     - chart-walk spend (line 1160)             -> SURVIVES
   3 of 9 explicitly-named fix sites (the budget-vs-actual chart walk)
   have ZERO regression coverage in the shipped diff. The manifest's own
